      "obligation": "refuter:25:1",
      "id": "def-cm09-coupled-quadratic-model",
      "location": "Definition (a)–(b)",
      "defect": "ill-formed",
      "evidence": "Clause (a) supplies an interval and force only “when the model is read as forced,” but clause (b) defines the equation for t∈I₀ and every motion on an interval J⊆I₀. The free case J≡0 therefore has no specified I₀, leaving the equation and motion domain undefined for that case. The later free-mode theorem’s choice of ℝ does not supply a domain convention in this definition.",
      "severity": "fatal",
      "observed_sha256": "d35327950eb672a0e0c882dbc02349528c09b54187a2a3f9977cc0b0103b2d85"
    }
  ],
  "reader_findings": [
